        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: Afro-Surrealism\n- People: Bob Kaufman, Krista Franklin, Kool Keith, Samuel R. Delany, Romare Bearden, Deana Lawson, Keith Thornton\n- Places: The Bronx, New York\n- Roles: rapper\n\nFacts:\n- Keith Thornton was born on October 7, 1963.\n- Keith Thornton is better known by the stage name Kool Keith.\n- Kool Keith is an American rapper from The Bronx, New York.\n- Kool Keith is known for surreal, abstract, and often profane or incomprehensible lyrics.\n- Afro-Surrealism includes notable practitioners such as Bob Kaufman, Krista Franklin, Kool Keith, Samuel R. Delany, Romare Bearden, and Deana Lawson.",
